		{"id":"n-fastlane","type":"text","text":"⚡ **Fast-Lane 패턴** _(개선)_\n_\"inbox 두지 말고 바로 분류해줘\"_\n→ `/save` + `/organize-resources`\n연속 실행, PARA 서브폴더 직행","x":-980,"y":-750,"width":280,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n-fix","type":"text","text":"**`/fix-notes`**\nfrontmatter 누락 교정\n파일명 kebab-case 정규화","x":-980,"y":-610,"width":280,"height":90,"color":"4"},
